The query is designed to find all films that have a director and an actor with the same surname. The entities `x` and `y` are variables representing Person entities, and the conditions ensure that the film has a director (x) and there exists an actor (y) with the same surname as the director.

```json
{
  "find": "films",
  "where": {
    "and": [
      { "rel": "director", "to": "x" },
      {
        "exists": {
          "rel": "actor",
          "to": "y"
